<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 10.70 from 10.71pct.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 10.70 from 10.71pct.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month dipped to 10.70 from 10.71 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) eased to 10.20 from 10.21 percent.</p>
